# Almanac API (`pathfinder/`)

This repo is **API-only** — Next.js `/api/*`, Prisma, domain + AI libs for the Expo client in `pathfinder-mobile/`.

**Canonical agent rules:** [`AGENTS.md`](./AGENTS.md)

**Read first:** [`../docs/current/ALMANAC-PRODUCT-CANON.md`](../docs/current/ALMANAC-PRODUCT-CANON.md) · [`../docs/current/ALMANAC-SUBJECT-HISTORY-EXPERIENCE.md`](../docs/current/ALMANAC-SUBJECT-HISTORY-EXPERIENCE.md) · [`../docs/current/ALMANAC-MEMORY-INTEGRITY-SPEC.md`](../docs/current/ALMANAC-MEMORY-INTEGRITY-SPEC.md). History and archive files are evidence only.

**Desktop web UI:** removed — see [`DESKTOP-ON-HOLD.md`](./DESKTOP-ON-HOLD.md). Do not extend retired tree/map UI.

**After changes:** `npx tsc --noEmit` · `npm test` when touching `src/lib/`

**Never touch without asking:** `prisma/schema.prisma`, NextAuth config, `src/app/api/auth/`

**AI:** legacy AI routes may remain, but the current persisted Almanac slice
must not add an internal AI call. Any existing AI call stays server-side.
